# GraceOS: CottonCandy opens web links and HTML files. A user's own ~/.config/mimeapps.list
# (Make CottonCandy the default browser, xdg-settings, or another browser's setting) still wins.
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=org.graceos.CottonCandy.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=org.graceos.CottonCandy.desktop
text/html=org.graceos.CottonCandy.desktop
application/xhtml+xml=org.graceos.CottonCandy.desktop
